{"channelId":"UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","row":["Rebecca Hale",12,"Pediatric Physical Therapist & Human Movement Specialist\n\nRebecca Hale is a Pediatric Physical Therapist and Human Movement Specialist. She currently works in the Chelsea school system with grades 1-12. She works with student’s body control, strength, and balance to decrease barriers of attention and behavior to better access the learning and the school environment.\n\nRebecca has worked in the industry for 22 years and has experience with clients ranging from three months to one hundred three years of age. Her passion is working with children on the autism spectrum and those disconnected by traumatic experiences. She helps children and parents access their body’s innate wisdom and find comfort in their own anatomy. She also helps people interpret children’s behaviors and how they relate to the physiological needs of each individual.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:45.260Z","channelId":"UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0a0ee198d3afd8295e983fb454399b81cbeeabc30de54f48a89e94a2432c619b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"431e2d914f06af1dde9b39af59483bcbe645172fe51169f21059d3b035962b21"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":12,"raw":"12 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5rE2sko91iVkcUIJsQ3nAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:45.260Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtu